# Defect 2490 (panel 248's R3): a working folder `hero_run_dir` stages is
# held until `hero_run_reset()` gives it back, as a variable `hero_run_env`
# stages is (feature 2424's case beside this one), so a program that stages
# one and never gives it back is told so at exit, the call that gives it back
# named, apart from the variables and never as a runtime call that kept what
# it borrowed. Staged twice, it is still one folder.
extern "hero_os.h"
    function hero_run_dir(folder: str)

function main()
    hero_run_dir(folder: "build")
    hero_run_dir(folder: "build/again")
    print("staged")
